    narr:narration """Freya Free's expressions here trace a single exchange over cutover staffing, opening with [a request to lay out the plan](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_5) and a brief [acknowledgment](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_8) before she sets out [the staffing math behind a single region's rota](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_11) and states flatly [that the needed people don't exist](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_12). She reframes the disagreement from [risk to arithmetic](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_14) and names [the one constraint that doesn't move](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_16), while also pointing to [a second, non-staffing benefit of sequencing cutovers one at a time](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_18) and confirming it with [a short affirmation](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_20). She qualifies her own position by admitting [she'd still favor sequencing even with more staff, though less forcefully, and would lead with the staffing case before the steering group](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_22), then sets [the condition she needs going forward](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_28) and closes [settled](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_30), having opened the exchange with [a claim that this is the only shape that works](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_9) and [simple willingness](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_4). A later comment re-raises [the same soak-protection condition, tied to her supervisors being back on the floor](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_18), showing the condition carried forward past the original exchange.""" ;
    narr:reaction """The arc itself hasn't moved — the exchange still reads as staffing arithmetic reframed from risk, closing settled. What's new is [a later comment re-raising the soak-protection condition](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_18): the condition she set at the close is now being pressed again days afterward, which sharpens the tension between [her settled ending](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_30) and whether the commitment actually held.""" ;
